      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "G'day, doctor. Now, my daughter Kerry reckons I've been forgetting things, and I said it's just old age, but she insisted, so here I am. Lovely clinic, by the way, I like the plants.",
